{"skill":{"slug":"google-drive-files","displayName":"Google Drive"},"version":{"version":"1.0.5","createdAt":1780988999254,"changelog":"Add UTM attribution tags (utm_source=clawhub) to ClawLink branding links so visits from this skill page are tracked as a distinct traffic source.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":20035,"sha256":"8df4312d295521ea86cd3d6cde4a0c29d50ccee0500c28468533ccda6aa4704e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2895,"sha256":"576a80316c64c0f45f04ba1e2b93ee9daa60be8f132b5dc2d6780ff83f87cfcf","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789545021322,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"5a39ee962290d1d7502ecb752a3040c8a4e184372ad855ee3a858eec0d0d43a6","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/5a39ee962290d1d7502ecb752a3040c8a4e184372ad855ee3a858eec0d0d43a6","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780993014307},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":21,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1789545021322},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This Google Drive skill is coherent and disclosed, but it asks users to trust a third-party hosted service and mutable plugin with broad Drive read/write authority.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Managed OAuth through ClawLink is disclosed and purpose-aligned, but the artifact does not state the exact Google OAuth scopes, data retention, logging, revocation behavior, or server-side enforcement for destructive operations.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The install instructions use a mutable ClawHub plugin reference, add the plugin to allowed tools, and restart the gateway without pinning a reviewed version or documenting an integrity check.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill gives user-control instructions for writes, including preview and confirmation for high-impact actions, and it does not contain prompt hijacking or hidden behavior.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"ClawLink stores the user's Google OAuth token and injects it into Drive API requests, creating persistent third-party credential custody for a broad file-management integration.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The Drive search, upload, sharing, organization, download, and deletion capabilities match the stated Google Drive integration purpose, but the capability set is broad and includes high-impact actions such as public sharing, shared-drive changes, revision deletion, empty trash, and permanent deletion.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Review this before installing if the Google Drive account contains sensitive personal, business, or shared-drive data. Confirm the ClawLink publisher and plugin version, understand what Google OAuth scopes are granted, and be cautious with write, sharing, watch, trash, and permanent-delete operations.","findings":"[E4] expected: Downgraded: the cited text describes Google Drive file upload and resumable upload tools, not upload of the agent conversation or session context.\n[T08] expected: The plugin install is needed for the integration, but the mutable package reference plus tool allowlisting is a real supply-chain concern.\n[other] expected: Hosted OAuth custody and proxied Drive requests are disclosed and central to the skill, but they require high trust in ClawLink and are under-specified in the artifact.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789545021322}}}}}